                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.5.1+MRK.5.2+MRK.5.3+MRK.5.4+MRK.5.5+MRK.5.6+MRK.5.7+MRK.5.8+MRK.5.9+MRK.5.10+MRK.5.11+MRK.5.12+MRK.5.13+MRK.5.14+MRK.5.15+MRK.5.16+MRK.5.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 5:1-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaayambukire seeri omu ishaza ry'Abagadarene, yaabuganwa abantu babiri abaabaire bariho baadaimoni, nibaruga omu bituuro, bagwire munonga eiraro, hatariho muntu owaakwehanga kuraba ogwo muhanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baamureebire, baayomba munonga nibagira bati: Noofa ki naitwe, Iwe Omwana wa Ruhanga? Oizire kutuburabuza, obunaku bwaitu butakahikire? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho hakaba hariho omukumbi gw'empunu nyingi hangahari nizirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadaimoni baamweshengyereza bati: Ku oraabe ori ow'okutubinga, twohereze omu mpunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagira ati: Nimwirooko! Baarugamu, baataaha omu mpunu; ahonaaho empunu ezo zoona zaarigita, nizishuuma aha ibanga, zaahwera omu nyanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abariisa baazo bairuka, baataaha omuri tauni, baabagambira byona, n'ebyaba aha bantu abaabaire bariho baadaimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'omuri tauni boona baahwayo, baija kubugana Yesu; kubaamureebire, baamweshengyereza kubarugira omu nsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
